# follow, group, gtell and split, then order and groups with charmed mobs. In the temple (3001): Purser (10, with
# 100 gold and 503 silver), Decimus (10), Quintus (25) and Weary (2). Then a fido (3062) and a beggar (3065) are
# charmed to follow Purser, and a wolf (3094) is made its pet. Ordered mobs run the commands' NPC branches; what
# they're told goes to no one, as mobs have no connection, and a mob can't tell (create_mobile sets NOTELL).
@connect purse
Purser
psswrd
@return
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@connect quin
Quintus
psswrd
@return
@connect weary
Weary
psswrd
@return
@as dec
order all say hi
group nobody
follow
follow nobody
follow self
follow purser
group
@as purse
group
group decimus
group
nofollow
group
nofollow
@as dec
follow purser
@as quin
follow purser
@as purse
nofollow
@as weary
follow purser
@as purse
nofollow
@as dec
follow purser
@as quin
follow purser
@as weary
follow decimus
follow quintus
@as purse
group decimus
group quintus
group weary
group purser
group
@as dec
group
group quintus
gtell hello, group
;the short form
gtell
