# nofollow sends every follower away, the charmed ones too: that takes their charm, and the wolf stops being a pet.
nofollow
@state
order beggar say free
nofollow
# A new pet fades away when its owner quits.
@mob 3094 3001
@charm pet
@pulse 12
quit
@as dec
look
